values ('ap_precalculus', 1, '1.4', array['1.4']::text[], 'convention', 'Extrema between zeros', 'Between every two distinct real zeros of a nonconstant polynomial function there must be at least one input value corresponding to a local maximum or local minimum.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u1-r2-006; ced=1.4.A.3: "Between every two distinct real zeros of a nonconstant polynomial function, there must be at least one input value corresponding to a local maximum or local minimum."')
